--- !u!114 &1227539422
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1227539417}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b272f464512c6b342895378e37ad94c8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1074427925}
  dialogueLines:
  - speakerName: "\u2014"
    message: A dream... or maybe a memory.
  - speakerName: Lia
    message: Ray! Come see what I made!
  - speakerName: Ray
    message: Two empty cans and a string?
  - speakerName: Lia
    message: "It\u2019s the most advanced technology in the world. Here, say something.\t"
  - speakerName: Ray
    message: ...Lia? Can you hear me?
  - speakerName: Lia
    message: "I can hear you! And I\u2019ll always hear you, even when we\u2019re
      far apart."
  - speakerName: Ray
    message: You know this thing only works up to one meter, right?
  - speakerName: Lia
    message: "Then we\u2019ll just stretch the meter. Promise?"
  - speakerName: Ray
    message: "Promise. And I\u2019ll always be the one who finds you."
  - speakerName: "\u2014"
    message: Lia rests her head on his shoulder. The world is quiet.
  - speakerName: "\u2014"
    message: The light flickers. The string snaps.
  - speakerName: Lia
    message: Ray... did you hear that?
  - speakerName: Ray
    message: "It\u2019s just the power."
  - speakerName: Lia
    message: "No. They\u2019re coming."
  - speakerName: Lia
    message: "No. They\u2019re coming."
  - speakerName: "\u2014"
    message: "Footsteps. Masks. A hand grabs Lia. And Ray... his legs won\u2019t
      move."
  - speakerName: ???
    message: The dose is ready.
  - speakerName: Lia
    message: No... not now!
  - speakerName: "\u2014"
    message: A needle. Lia gasps.
  - speakerName: Lia
    message: "Ray. Listen to me. There\u2019s no time."
  - speakerName: Ray
    message: "Lia! I\u2019m here, I\u2019m\u2014"
  - speakerName: Lia
    message: "Every time you go back... you\u2019ll forget something about me."
  - speakerName: Ray
    message: What are you talking about?!
  - speakerName: Lia
    message: "This isn\u2019t the first time, Ray. And look for me... just not here."
  - speakerName: Lia
    message: Promise?
  - speakerName: Ray
    message: "...I pro\u2014"
  - speakerName: "\u2014"
    message: No sound comes out.
  - speakerName: "\u2014"
    message: The string falls to the floor.
  - speakerName: Ray
    message: ...I promise
  nextSceneName: GameScene
